le you care about (you said you like intimate gatherings and casual invites).\n- Reach out to specific classmates individually by text or DM.\n- Spend time making a memory album or journaling about high school nostalgia \u2014 you\u2019ve used journaling for reflection before.\n- Join the reunion\u2019s online groups or watch photos later if you want to catch up without attending.\n\nWant help?\nI can help you draft a short message to classmates, a polite RSVP, conversation starters tailored to specific people, or a plan for how long to stay. Which would you like?", "autoeval_label": {"model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "label": true}}
